*****************************************************************
* CABCIRIX - PRIMARY INDEX FOR THE CIRCUIT DATABASE (CABCIRDB)  *
* HIDAM INDEX POINTING BACK TO CIRCSEG BY CICKTID.  A HIDAM     *
* LOAD OR REORG OF CABCIRDB MUST REBUILD THIS DATASET IN THE    *
* SAME STEP - THE ROOT ADD ORDER IS DRIVEN BY THIS INDEX, NOT   *
* BY ARRIVAL SEQUENCE ON THE UNLOAD FILE.  DATASET               *
* TELCABS.IMS.CIRCIX ON THE VSAM KSDS GROUP DBDCIRX.             *
* REVISION HISTORY                                              *
*   V1.00  1990-07-16  R.OKAFOR    INITIAL GEN, PAIRED WITH      *
*                                  CABCIRDB V1.00                *
*   V1.01  1996-10-11  L.FENNIMORE NOTED FOR REBUILD WHEN         *
*                                  CIRCJUNC IS ADDED TO THE ROOT  *
*                                  DATABASE - SEE CABCIRDB        *
*   V1.02  2002-05-14  T.OKONKWO   INDEX DATASET RESIZED FOR      *
*                                  CIRCUIT COUNT GROWTH           *
*   V1.03  2014-04-02  M.OYELARAN  RECOMPILE ONLY                *
*****************************************************************
         PRINT NOGEN
CABCIRIX DBD   NAME=CABCIRIX,ACCESS=INDEX
*
DATASET  DD1=CIRCIX1,DEVICE=3390
*
* INDEX SEGMENT.  CARRIES THE SAME KEY AS THE ROOT IT POINTS TO
* PLUS THE INDEX TARGET POINTER APPENDED BY IMS AT GEN TIME.
*
SEGM     NAME=CIRCIDX,BYTES=24,PARENT=0
LCHILD   NAME=(CIRCSEG,CABCIRDB),INDEX=CICKTID
FIELD    NAME=(CICKTID,SEQ,U),BYTES=20,START=1,TYPE=C
*
DBDGEN
FINISH
END
